  </style>
---
{% from "prose-section.njk" import prose %}
{% set c = copy.pricing %}
<section class="hero" style="padding:120px 0 60px;">
  <div class="wrap">
    {{ prose(c.hero, level="h1", bodyClass="lede", headingClass="h1-compact") }}
  </div>
</section>
<svg class="seam" viewBox="0 0 1200 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,30 C300,70 900,-10 1200,30 L1200,60 L0,60 Z"/></svg>

<section>
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
    <p style="font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:3rem;">For existing Web sites, smaller updates, troubleshooting, and consulting, hourly work is available at $125/hour.</p>

    <div class="service">
      <h2>Web Site Design</h2>
      <p class="service-price">Starting at $1,500</p>
      <p>Thoughtful, custom Web sites for small businesses that need more than a template and a logo dropped into place.</p>
      <p>Whether you're starting from scratch or replacing a site that no longer reflects your business, I'll help shape the structure, messaging, design, and overall experience so everything feels intentional and easy to use.</p>
      <p>Web site projects may include:</p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Custom page design</li>
        <li>Mobile-responsive layouts</li>
        <li>Content organization and site structure</li>
        <li>Strategic calls to action</li>
        <li>Contact or inquiry forms</li>
        <li>Basic SEO setup</li>
        <li>Domain and launch support</li>
        <li>Wix, Squarespace, WordPress, or another platform when appropriate</li>
      </ul>
      <p>More involved Web sites, ecommerce, memberships, booking systems, custom integrations, and larger page counts are quoted based on scope.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
      <h2>Custom Software</h2>
      <p class="service-price">Starting at $2,500</p>
      <p>Sometimes the right solution isn't another off-the-shelf platform.</p>
      <p>I design and build custom tools for businesses that need something more specific, from client intake systems and internal dashboards to portals, forms, workflows, calculators, and lightweight SaaS products.</p>
      <p>Custom software projects may include:</p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Client or staff portals</li>
        <li>Intake and onboarding systems</li>
        <li>Custom forms and workflows</li>
        <li>Dashboards</li>
        <li>Scheduling or tracking tools</li>
        <li>Small business applications</li>
        <li>Database-driven tools</li>
        <li>Automations and integrations</li>
        <li>Custom internal systems</li>
        <li>Early-stage SaaS products and prototypes</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Because software projects can vary dramatically in complexity, each one is scoped and quoted individually.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
      <h2>Digital Solutions</h2>
      <p class="service-price">Starting at $500</p>
      <p>Not every project needs a full Web site or custom application.</p>
      <p>Sometimes you need someone who can look at the problem, figure out what isn't working, and build the right solution.</p>
      <p>Digital solution projects may include:</p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Web site improvements</li>
        <li>New landing pages</li>
        <li>Custom forms</li>
        <li>Integrations</li>
        <li>Automations</li>
        <li>Troubleshooting</li>
        <li>Technical setup</li>
        <li>Client experience improvements</li>
        <li>Workflow improvements</li>
        <li>Small custom tools</li>
        <li>Existing-site updates</li>
        <li>Platform migrations or cleanup</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If the project is better handled hourly rather than as a fixed-price package, my hourly rate is $125.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="service">
      <h2>Existing Web sites + Ongoing Support</h2>
      <p class="service-price">$125/hour</p>
      <p>Already have a Web site or digital product that needs attention?</p>
      <p>I also work with existing sites and systems for updates, improvements, troubleshooting, design refinements, and technical support.</p>
      <p>This is a good fit for:</p>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>Content and design updates</li>
        <li>New pages or sections</li>
        <li>Mobile layout fixes</li>
        <li>Wix or Squarespace help</li>
        <li>Form setup</li>
        <li>Troubleshooting</li>
        <li>Small development changes</li>
        <li>Integrations</li>
        <li>Technical cleanup</li>
        <li>Consulting and strategy</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For larger updates, I may recommend a fixed project price instead of hourly billing.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
